  "controlled_change": "Opt-in read-only native contact-time transforms and local points; new pure diagnostic consumer. Default disabled; no controller, foot classifier, impulse, geometry, solver or evaluator changes.",
  "capture_contract": {
    "profile_id": "godot_4_7_jolt_sporespore_contact_frames_v7",
